{"version":1,"content":"<p>海關連日（17日及18日）在香港國際機場偵破兩宗旅客販運毒品的案件，分別拘捕一男一女，共檢獲約5.4公斤可卡因、約17公斤大麻花及15粒阿普唑侖，總市值約680萬元。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T11:39:21.754598+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":83,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T10:29:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-18T14:57:34.353386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T11:37:58.776006+00:00","content_hash":"fccba6e9090134d346327c0f669ca12d368e73cf574172060649f0367ba15d0c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}